<title>USA: Western National Corp Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Western National Corp Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				   Quarter Ended   Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				     September 30	September 30</p>
<p>				    1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p>Operating revenues	  $184.1   $179.8   $536.6   $517.5</p>
<p>Operating earnings (a)	24.7     22.8     72.9     67.5</p>
<p>Realized investment gains</p>
<p>     (losses) (b)		0.9    (13.3)    (1.9)   (39.0)</p>
<p>Net income			$25.6     $9.5    $71.0    $28.5</p>
<p>Per Common Share:</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>     outstanding		 63.9     62.4     63.2     62.4</p>
<p>Operating earnings (a)	$0.39    $0.37    $1.15    $1.08</p>
<p>Realized investment gains</p>
<p>     (losses) (b)		0.01    (0.22)   (0.03)   (0.62)</p>
<p>Net income			$0.40    $0.15    $1.12    $0.46</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>(a)  Earnings excluding realized investment gains (losses) less applicable expenses and taxes.</p>
<p>(b)  Realized gains and losses from the investment of policyholder balances can affect the timing of the amortization of the cost of policies purchased, amortization of the cost of policies produced and additions to insurance liabilities.</p>
<p>The resulting change in amortization and additions to insurance liabilities net of applicable income taxes is charged against realized gains and losses in determining realized investment gains (losses).</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
